      { kit: 'bullets', style: 'recap', items: ['MAX maximises, MIN minimises, turn by turn', 'Values are passed up from the leaves', 'Alpha–beta skips branches that cannot change the result', 'Same answer as minimax, far less work'], chapter: 'Recap', say: 'Remember: MAX maximises, MIN minimises. Values flow up from the leaves. Alpha beta pruning skips hopeless branches and gets the same answer much faster.' }
